Third-party license for this protocol package
=============================================

The Runway wire-protocol field mappings and the fixed success samples in this
package's `manifest.json` and its Go tests were derived from LiteLLM's
MIT-licensed provider code, taken from files outside LiteLLM's `enterprise/`
directory:

- Project: <https://github.com/BerriAI/litellm>
- Commit: dddbaa803d6e9fcc862ea7a5412f771cb1ae040e
- Files consulted: `litellm/llms/runwayml/videos/transformation.py`,
  `tests/unit/llms/runwayml/videos/test_runway_video_transformation.py`,
  `litellm/constants.py` (the default `X-Runway-Version` value)

They were re-expressed as BeefTV declarative manifest templates and Go tests.
No Python runtime or Python source is shipped. The derived material is
distributed under LiteLLM's MIT license, reproduced in full below. Everything
else in this package is part of BeefTV and uses BeefTV's own license.

